<title>AUSTRALIA: QCT Resources year net profit leaps.</title>
<headline>QCT Resources year net profit leaps.</headline>
<dateline>BRISBANE 1996-09-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		   112.73 vs 53.04</p>
<p>    Net				     71.47 vs 29.54</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)	     5.00 vs 5.00</p>
<p>NOTE: QCT Resources Ltd is a coal miner and is about 22 percent owned by Santos Ltd.  </p>
<p>    Total dividend (cents)	    10.25 vs 9.00</p>
<p>    Sales				  747.06 vs 618.39</p>
<p>    Other income			  25.21 vs 23.44</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			   11.07 vs 4.87</p>
<p>    Abnormal items		profit 6.55 vs profit 1.86</p>
<p>Dividend is 100 percent franked</p>
<p>Pay date Oct 25</p>
<p>Reg date Oct 16</p>
<p>    Tax				     47.81 vs 23.37</p>
<p>    Interest				14.73 vs 23.09</p>
<p>    Depreciation			  53.12 vs 48.28</p>
<p>    Minorities				nil vs nil</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
